      "title": "Red Cat Holdings Q3 Earnings Call Withdraws Sales Target for 2026",
      "summary": "Red Cat Holdings (RCAT) withdrew its 2026 revenue guidance after Q3 sales of $11.8M missed estimates of $38.8M due to defense funding delays and contract award postponements. The company's Blue Ops maritime division secured its first U.S. government order for two B-26 vessels with a $2.3B pipeline, while the aerial systems pipeline stands at $440M. RCAT faces significant margin pressure (0.6% gross margin vs. 6.6% prior year), elevated inventory levels, and cash outflows, with the Steyr Motors acquisition expected to close in late January 2027.",
      "url": "https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3033158/red-cat-holdings-q3-earnings-call-withdraws-sales-target-for-2026?cid=CS-ZC-FT-analyst_blog_plus|earnings_call_takeaways-3033158",
