      "title": "Red Cat's USV Mix: Could Blue Ops Accelerate Margin Gains in H2?",
      "summary": "Red Cat Holdings (RCAT) expects gross margins to reach ~30% by end-2026 as its Blue Ops maritime division scales production of Variant 7 uncrewed surface vessels (USVs). Blue Ops moved into mass production in Q2 2026 and could achieve profitability by year-end. However, RCAT faces intensifying competition from established players like Huntington Ingalls and Textron, with the stock down 24.9% in the past month and holding a Zacks Rank #4 (Sell) rating.",
